[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:17.24]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:22.66]left a single note and went on their way
[00:27.52]I never got their name until the credits
[00:31.74]now it plays here every single day
[00:36.26]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:40.06]One note at a time
[00:46.52]from people passing through
[00:50.38]a name beside a line
[00:56.58]and part of it is you
[01:01.58]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
